  </data>
  <data name="OnexCaption699.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Does NOT fix the fan panic. The panic is an EC firmware latch that only a full shutdown clears. For investigation only — stopping these tasks can make a stuck fan worse.</value>
  </data>
