  <data name="OnexCaption704.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fan max test (Full Blast) — diagnostic only</value>
  </data>
  <data name="OnexCaption705.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Forces the EC full-speed override to check whether 100% (EC 150) is really the absolute fan max. Turn ON, wait a few seconds, Read RPM; compare with Aggressive@100%. Turn OFF afterwards.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="OnexCaption706.Content" xml:space="preserve">
