  <data name="OnexCaption1540.Text" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>When a non-Xbox device (e.g. DualShock 4) is emulated, temporarily present it as an Xbox 360 pad while the Game Bar is open so the overlay navigates cleanly (some pads spam the right trigger). Swaps back on close. Briefly disconnects the virtual controller — a running game may notice.</value>
